    <string name="login_privacy_dialog_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="login_privacy_dialog_text"><![CDATA[
    The "Mehrban" application respects your privacy and that of your children. To provide safe and stable services, we need to collect certain information.

    What data is collected?
    During registration and usage, we collect your mobile number, full name, national ID, email, address, and data about the apps used by your child (Usage Stats).

    Why do we use this data?
    Your phone number and national ID are used solely for parental identity verification and to prevent unauthorized access to child settings. User information and email are used for support, account recovery, and notifications. Usage data is processed exclusively to enforce the limits you set.

    Commitment to data security
    We explicitly guarantee that all your personal data and your children\'s data remain completely confidential and secure with the developer. This data will never be sold, misused, or shared with any person, organization, or third party for advertising or commercial purposes. All data is transmitted between your device and our servers using secure encryption protocols.
    ]]></string>
